<title>GERMANY: Thyssen sells 24.9 pct of Rhein. Kalkstein.</title>
<headline>Thyssen sells 24.9 pct of Rhein. Kalkstein.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thyssen AG said it had sold a 24.9 percent interest in Rheinische Kalksteinwerke GmbH to a Belgian investment group owned by Lhoist SA, but that it retained majority control.  </p>
<p>Thyssen will continue to manage the Wuelfrath-based company. The purchase takes effect today.</p>
<p>-- Terence Gallagher, Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
